OL,3,GNEWSAAssault inquiry dropped after
OL,4,Asuspect fails to attend interview
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was assaulted by a man in
OL,7,FManchester city centre has said she was
OL,8,F"demoralised" after police dropped
OL,9,Ftheir investigation before a suspect
OL,10,Fcould be questioned.
OL,12,FEmily Geer, 33, from Manchester, said
OL,13,Fshe was physically assaulted in April
OL,14,Fand had provided Greater Manchester
OL,15,FPolice with video footage of the
OL,16,Fincident.
OL,18,FShe said she received a text from the
OL,19,Fforce months later telling her the
OL,20,Finvestigation had been dropped because
OL,21,Fthe time limit for bringing a
OL,22,Fprosecution had expired.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
