OL,3,GNEWSAAssault inquiry dropped after
OL,4,Asuspect fails to attend interview
OL,5,
OL,6,FA GMP spokesperson said its handling of
OL,7,Fthe case had "fallen well short of the
OL,8,Fstandard any victim in Greater
OL,9,FManchester should receive".
